{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of Grandfather</strong> is an intense psychological horror experience.<br>At midnight, you return to your grandfather's house after years of absence. But the house is no longer the same. Every room holds a memory from the past, and every silence echoes with a whisper.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We add deeper interaction using the player\u2019s microphone; your voice can trigger certain events in the house and heighten the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the dark secrets of the house, you must find notes, keys, and mysterious books. But be careful\u2026 you are not alone in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal events and exploration-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet impactful puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone-supported interaction: your voice can trigger events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound and environmental design that heightens tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, cinematic visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness. But remember: this house is waiting for you\u2026 and it won\u2019t let you leave.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137730?t=1766002981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137730?t=1766002981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137730/ae4b1601677439e789c39c706e70336cbfa8bdc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766002981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137730/ae4b1601677439e789c39c706e70336cbfa8bdc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766002981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violence, blood, and horror themes that may be disturbing to some players.\r\nIt features dark environments, jump scares, and intense situations."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of Grandfather</strong> is an intense psychological horror experience.<br>At midnight, you return to your grandfather's house after years of absence. But the house is no longer the same. Every room holds a memory from the past, and every silence echoes with a whisper.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We add deeper interaction using the player\u2019s microphone; your voice can trigger certain events in the house and heighten the tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the dark secrets of the house, you must find notes, keys, and mysterious books. But be careful\u2026 you are not alone in this house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal events and exploration-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet impactful puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone-supported interaction: your voice can trigger events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound and environmental design that heightens tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, cinematic visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness. But remember: this house is waiting for you\u2026 and it won\u2019t let you leave.</p>","developers":["MED Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image